  "attribution_notes": [
    "2103 ECS lifecycle events use AWSServiceRoleForECS, ecs.amazonaws.com, or kanbien-staging-ecs-task-execution-role. Log groups are pre-existing /ecs/kanbien-staging-service-platform (231 streams) and /aws/ecs/containerinsights/kanbien-staging/performance (949 streams); ENIs/target removal reference old kanbien-staging-app-sg and kanbien-staging-app-tg.",
    "Nine ELB-managed network events use AWSServiceRoleForElasticLoadBalancing invoked by elasticloadbalancing.amazonaws.com. Four AllocateAddress/AssociateAddress events and their ENI/EIP resources are retained below. No CreateLoadBalancer/ModifyLoadBalancer or user network-provisioning event appears in the complete management-write set. Specific ALB ARN linkage is not exposed in sanitized records and has not been independently queried; keep these service-managed resources.",
    "32 Cognito Token_POST events are consistent with two token requests per sixteen pre-existing scheduled synthetic runs. Their recorded identity is Unknown; this is timing/count correlation, not cryptographic actor attribution.",
